      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "That feeling of being invisible within a rigid system is incredibly draining and makes your identity feel disconnected from your actions. It often happens when the external environment dictates your entire existence without room for personal meaning or reflection. I'm truly sorry you're going through this loss of self, as recognizing these emotions is the first step toward reconnecting with your humanity.",
      "source": "target",
