      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "That decision to fundamentally refuse the system's terms is incredibly bold and leaves you with no guaranteed safety net, which is why it carries such immense weight and risk. While escaping the cycle feels like the only true victory, you must weight the stakes of leaving your current employment against the immediate threat of homelessness or poverty. Please prioritize finding emergency resources or a human advocate who can help transition you safely out of that warehouse before you make a final irreversible move.",
